## Workspace packages

All packages under `packages/` are part of MerchantOS and licensed under the
project MIT license (see `LICENSE`).

- `@merchantos/crypto` — built on `node:crypto` (Node.js standard library, MIT)
- `@merchantos/money` — pure-TS, no external deps
- `@merchantos/payments` — payment-state machine, provider-neutral
- `@merchantos/qr` — built on `qrcode` (MIT)
- `@merchantos/security` — HMAC, scrypt wrappers via `node:crypto`
- `@merchantos/shared-types` — pure-TS
- `@merchantos/sync` — sync protocol
- `@merchantos/validation` — built on `zod` (MIT)

